grene antitoxin.\n\nAdequate surgical removal of devitalised tissue.\n\n. Ahigh initial dose of parenteral antibiotic.\n\nA prolonged course of parenteral antibiotic treatment.\nHyperbaric oxygen treatment prior to operative treatment.\n\nCommentary MCQ 1.9\n\nThe symptoms described, with bilateral sensory symptoms and involvement of\nsphincter control, suggest acute compression of either the cauda equina or the lower\nend of the spinal cord. With the involvement of the bladder and bowel it is urgent to\nestablish the cause of this compression. For this reason, of the options listed, urgent\nmagnetic resonance imaging (MRI) would be the most appropriate (E is"},"source_answer":null,"source_explanation":null,"source_answer_status":"pending_import","current_answer":null,"current_answer_status":"needs_verification","current_evidence":[],"currentness_risk":"medium","currentness_keywords":["age","management"],"likely_visual_question":false,"parser_confidence":"high","parser_mode":"strict_ocr_tolerant","text_method":"tesseract","parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","stem_hash":"197401807ab55e9d342653a9a72d10d4776a0987","duplicate_group_id":"exact-197401807ab5","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"685fe9e75670eb96d906","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_relative_path":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_page":33,"source_qid":null}]}',0,'v2.9.4','2026-09-24T00:00:00.000Z') ON CONFLICT(record_id) DO UPDATE SET source_file=excluded.source_file,source_page=excluded.source_page,domain=excluded.domain,stem=excluded.stem,options_json=excluded.options_json,source_answer=excluded.source_answer,source_explanation=excluded.source_explanation,provenance_json=excluded.provenance_json,visual_asset=excluded.visual_asset,visual_url=excluded.visual_url,options_mode=excluded.options_mode,current_answer=excluded.current_answer,current_answer_status=ex