the management of this boy''s blood pressure?','{"A":"Measure serum creatinine.","B":"Monitor 24-hour blood pressure.","C":"Obtain a urinalysis.","D":"Check blood pressure cuff size.","E":"Obtain an electrocardiogram.\n\nExample\nMCQ 1.15 — CONFUSION AFTER A HEAD INJURY"}',NULL,NULL,'{"source_relative_path":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","supporting_pages":[43],"source_qid":null,"duplicate_group_id":"exact-4cde6534792a","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"62d2eaf94679bf987e09","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_relative_path":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_page":43,"source_qid":null}],"parser_version":"2.8-residual-resolver-selective-ocr-visual-2026-09-22","parser_mode":"v28_multi_question_group","text_method":"tesseract","visual_asset":null,"asset_preview_url":null}',NULL,NULL,'text',NULL,'needs_verification','[]','medium','{"record_id":"62d2eaf94679bf987e09","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_relative_path":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_year":null,"source_page":43,"supporting_pages":[43],"source_qid":null,"domain_hint":"Mixed/Unclassified","stem":"A 16-year-old boy is seen for routine medical examination. On examination his height\nis 170cm (25th percentile), weight 88kg (95th percentile). His BP is 160/70mmHg. His\nheart rate is 75/min. Which one of the following is the most appropriate next step in\nthe management of this boy''s blood pressure?","options":{"A":"Measure serum creatinine.","B":"Monitor 24-hour blood pressure.","C":"Obtain a urinalysis.","D":"Check blood pressure cuff size.","E":"Obtain an electrocardiogram.\n\nExample\nMCQ 1.15 — CONFUSION AFTER A HEAD INJURY"},"options_mode":"text","source_answer":null,"source_explanation":null,"source_answer_status":"pending_import","current_ans