F Australian Medical Council
& Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions
Example
MCQ 1.21 — SCREENING FOR HEPATOMA IN HEPATITIS C RELATED CIRRHOSIS
__ A 35-year-old injecting drug user has developed Hepatitis C related cirrhosis. In
addition to imaging, which one of the following is the most appropriate surveillance
test to screen for likely future development of malignant hepatoma?
A. Alpha-fetoprotein.
B. Beta hCG.
C. Carcinoembryonic antigen.
D. Alkaline phosphatase.
E. CD4 count.
Example
MCQ 1.22 — CHEST PAIN AND DYSPNOEA SEVEN DAYS AFTER
CHOLECYSTECTOMY
Seven days after an elective cholecystectomy, a 65-year-old man _ collapses
complaining of sudden onset of chest pain and shortness of breath. Which one of the
following diagnostic investigations is likely to be the most helpful?','{"A":"Electrocardiography (ECG).","B":"Ventilation/perfusion lung scan.","C":"Chest X-ray.","D":"Calf and thigh venography.","E":"Doppler duplex ultrasound scan of thigh veins.\nCommentary MCQ 1.14\nSphygmomanometers to measure blood pressure comprise a cuff with an inflatable"}',NULL,NULL,'{"source_relative_path":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","supporting_pages":[45],"source_qid":null,"duplicate_group_id":"exact-d01518749274","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"60f712fa2ed66077dc83","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_relative_path":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_page":45,"source_qid":null}],"parser_version":"2.8-residual-resolver-selective-ocr-visual-2026-09-22","parser_mode":"v28_selective_ocr_multi_group","text_method":"v28_selective_ocr","visual_asset":null,"asset_preview_url":null}',NULL,NULL,'text',NULL,'needs_verification','[]','high','{"record_id":"60f712fa2ed66077dc83","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_relative_path":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_year":null,"source_page":45,"supporting_pages":[45],"source_qid":null,"domain_hint":"Mixed/Unclassified","stem":"[\nF Australian Medical Council\n& Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions\nExample\nMCQ 1.21 — SCREENING FOR HEPATOMA IN HEPATITIS C RELATED CIRRHOSIS\n__ A 35-year-old injecting drug user has developed Hepatitis C related cirrhosis. In\naddition to imaging, which one of the following is the most appropriate surveillance\ntest to screen for likely future development of malignant hepatoma?\nA. Alpha-fetoprotein.\nB. Beta hCG.\nC. Carcinoembryonic antigen.\nD. Alkaline phosphatase.\nE. CD4 count.\nExample\nMCQ 1.22 — CHEST PAIN AND DYSPNOEA SEVEN DAYS AFTER\nCHOLECYSTECTOMY\nSeven days after an elective cholecystectomy, a 65-year-old man _ collapses\ncomplaining of sudden onset of chest pain and shortness of breath. Which one of the\nfollowing diagnostic investigations is likely to be the most helpful?","options":{"A":"Electrocardiography (ECG).","B":"Ventilation/perfusion lung scan.","C":"Chest X-ray.","D":"Calf and thigh venography.","E":"Doppler duplex ultrasound scan of thigh veins.\nCommentary MCQ 1.14\nSphygmomanometers to measure blood pressure comprise a cuff with an inflatable"},"options_mode":"text","source_answer":null,"source_explanation":null,"source_answer_status":"pending_import","current_answer":null,"current_answer_status":"needs_verification","current_evidence":[],"currentness_risk":"high","currentness_keywords":["drug","screen","screening"],"likely_visual_question":true,"parser_confidence":"high","parser_mode":"v28_selective_ocr_multi_group","text_method":"v28_selective_ocr","parser_version":"2.8-residual-resolver-selective-ocr-visual-2026-09-22","stem_hash":"d01518749274d2c3d3d775348bb5d4debec2848b","duplicate_group_id":"exact-d01518749274","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"60f712fa2ed66077dc83","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_relative_path":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_page":45,"source_qid":null}]}',0,'v2.9.4','2026-09-24T00:00:00.000Z') ON CONFLICT(record_id) DO UPDATE SET source_file=excluded.source_file,source_page=excluded.source_page,domain=excluded.domain,stem=excluded.stem,options_json=excluded.options_json,source_answer=excluded.source_answer,source_explanation=excluded.source_explanation,provenance_json=excluded.provenance_json,visual_asset=excluded.visual_asset,visual_url=excluded.visual_url,options_mode=excluded.options_mode,current_answer=excluded.current_answer,current_answer_status=excluded.current_answer_status,current_evidence_json=excluded.current_evidence_json,currentn