MCQ 2.037
A 45-year-old woman had a lumpectomy, postoperative radiotherapy, adjuvant
chemotherapy and tamoxifen therapy at the age of 42 years for an oestrogen.
receptor-positive breast malignancy. She was prescribed tamoxifen in a dose
of 10mg per day and was to take it for the next five years. From the time she
completed her chemotherapy three years ago, she had no menstrual periods until
one week ago when she had an episode of light vaginal bleeding lasting for seven
days. She is still taking the tamoxifen. Which one of the following is the most likely
cause for the recent bleeding?','{"A":"Induction of follicular development by the tamoxifen.","B":"Endometrial polyp formation due to the tamoxifen.","C":"An endometrial cancer produced by the tamoxifen.","D":"Endometrial atrophy due to the tamoxifen.","E":"An endometrial metastasis from the breast cancer.\n\n07\nMCQ 2.038\n\nWhich one of the following is the most\neffective antibiotic to use locally for\na patient with a mucopurulent eye\ndischarge and a red eye as illustrated?\n\n. Gentamicin.\n\nStreptomycin.\n\n. Penicillin.\n\nTobramycin.\n\nChloramphenicol.\n\nTTMOQR2>\n\n—_—_eoeoooee————————\nMCQ 2.039\n\nA 60-year-old woman has a history\nof several years of pain in her\nleft shoulder when hanging out\nwashing and raising the arm above\nthe head away from the body.\nAfter a recent lifting strain the pain\nbecame acutely much worse and\nshe says she is now unable to lift\nthe arm up at all. The illustration\nshows her trying actively to abduct\nthe arm and represents the limit\nof her movement. On palpation\nher deltoid muscle is actively\n\ncontracting. The arm can be moved passively to full abduction. Which one of the\nfollowing is the most likely diagnosis?\n\nQ\nPeo ic) ayer =) beers | fe (0\n\nae. 2"}',NULL,NULL,'{"source_relative_path":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","supporting_pages":[],"source_qid":"2.037","duplicate_group_id":"exact-8ca778bc61dc","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"beeb841e939e4247adc5","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_relative_path":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_page":74,"source_qid":"2.037"}],"parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","parser_mode":"strict_ocr_tolerant","text_method":"tesseract","visual_asset":null,"asset_preview_url":null}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'needs_verification','[]','high','{"record_id":"beeb841e939e4247adc5","source_file":"96.Handbo