the breasts is normal. Her mother developed breast cancer at the age of 45 years
and subsequently died from metastases. The patient''s maternal grandmother also
had breast cancer before the age of 50. The patient is on the oral contraceptive
pill (OCP) and no other medications; her general health is normal. Mammography
is normal. An ultrasound of the breasts shows an uncomplicated cyst with no
concerning features in the right breast. Apart from advice about use of simple
analgesics and evening primrose oil for her mastalgia, which one of the following is
the most appropriate advice in the patient''s followup regimen?','{"A":"Cease the OCP, yearly clinical review, yearly mammography and ultrasound.","B":"Remain on the OCP, yearly clinical review, yearly mammography and\nultrasound.","C":"Remain on the OCP, six-monthly clinical review, yearly mammography and\nultrasound.","D":"Remain on the OCP, two-yearly clinical and mammography review.","E":"Cease the OCP, yearly clinical and ultrasound review.\n\nMCQ 2.049"}',NULL,NULL,'{"source_relative_path":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","supporting_pages":[77],"source_qid":"2.047","duplicate_group_id":"exact-216c9fb4e8d0","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"ff9cf018341e745ec6a5","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_relative_path":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_page":77,"source_qid":"2.047"}],"parser_version":"2.8-residual-resolver-selective-ocr-visual-2026-09-22","parser_mode":"v28_multi_question_group","text_method":"tesseract","visual_asset":null,"asset_preview_url":null}',NULL,NULL,'text',NULL,'needs_verification','[]','medium','{"record_id":"ff9cf018341e745ec6a5","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_relative_path":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_year":null,"source_page":77,"supporting_pages":[77],"source_qid":"2.047","domain_hint":"Mixed/Unclassified","stem":"A 35-year-old woman presents with cyclical mastalgia. Clinical examination of\nthe breasts is normal. Her mother developed breast cancer at the age of 45 years\nand subsequently died from metastases. The patient''s maternal grandmother also\nhad breast cancer before the age of 50. The patient is on the oral contraceptive\npill (OCP) and no other medications; her general health is normal. Mammography\nis normal. An ultrasound of the breasts shows an uncomplicated cyst with no\nconcerning features in the right breast. Apart from advice about use of simple\nanalgesics and evening primrose oil for her mastalgia, which one of the following is\nthe most appropriate advice in the patient''s followup regimen?","options":{"A":"Cease the OCP, yearly clinical review, yearly mammography and ultrasound.","B":"Remain on the OCP, yearly clinical review, yearly mammography and\nultrasound.","C":"Remain on the OCP, six-monthly clinical review, yearly mammography and\nultrasound.","D":"Remain on the OCP, two-yearly clinical and mammography review.","E":"Cease the OCP, yearly clinical and ultrasound review.\n\nMCQ 2.049"},"options_mode":"text","source_answer":null,"source_explanation":null,"source_answer_status":"pending_import","current_answer":null,"current_answer_status":"needs_verification","current_evidence":[],"currentness_risk":"medium","currentness_keywords":["age","contracept"],"likely_visual_question":false,"parser_confidence":"high","parser_mode":"v28_multi_question_group","text_method":"tesseract","parser_version":"2.8-residual-resolver-selective-ocr-visual-2026-09-22","stem_hash":"216c9fb4e8d09e04e52fca8667002a726a010e6c","duplicate_group_id":"exact-216c9fb4e8d0","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"ff9cf018341e745ec6a5","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_relative_path":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_page":77,"source_qid":"2.047"}]}',0,'v2.9.4','2026-09-24T00:00:00.000Z') ON CONFLICT(record_id) DO UPDATE SET source_file=excluded.source_file,source_page=excluded.source_page,domain=excluded.domain,stem=excluded.stem,options_json=excluded.options_json,source_answer=excluded.source_answer,source_explanation=excluded.source_explanation,provenance_json=excluded.provenance_json,visual_asset=excluded.visual_asset,visual_url=excluded.visual_url,options_mode=excluded.options_mode,current_answer=excluded.current_answer,