which commenced four months ago. A blood count shows that she has a normal
blood film apart from a platelet count of 20x10°/L (150-400). Physical examination is
unremarkable apart from an enlarged spleen which is palpable 3cm below the left
costal margin. Which one of the following is the most likely diagnosis?','{"A":"Iron deficiency.","B":"Immune thrombocytopenic purpura (ITP).","C":"Chronic lymphocytic leukaemia.","D":"Systemic lupus erythematosus (SLE).","E":"Portal hypertension.\n\nMCQ 2.055"}',NULL,NULL,'{"source_relative_path":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","supporting_pages":[79],"source_qid":"2.053","duplicate_group_id":"exact-4f90fa6d6b4a","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"00e24bedf41e134e3e4c","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_relative_path":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_page":79,"source_qid":"2.053"}],"parser_version":"2.8-residual-resolver-selective-ocr-visual-2026-09-22","parser_mode":"v28_multi_question_group","text_method":"tesseract","visual_asset":null,"asset_preview_url":null}',NULL,NULL,'text',NULL,'needs_verification','[]','low','{"record_id":"00e24bedf41e134e3e4c","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_relative_path":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_year":null,"source_page":79,"supporting_pages":[79],"source_qid":"2.053","domain_hint":"Mixed/Unclassified","stem":"A 24-year-old woman presents with bruising and excessive cyclical menstrual loss\nwhich commenced four months ago. A blood count shows that she has a normal\nblood film apart from a platelet count of 20x10°/L (150-400). Physical examination is\nunremarkable apart from an enlarged spleen which is palpable 3cm below the left\ncostal margin. Which one of the following is the most likely diagnosis?","options":{"A":"Iron deficiency.","B":"Immune thrombocytopenic purpura (ITP).","C":"Chronic lymphocytic leukaemia.","D":"Systemic lupus erythematosus (SLE).","E":"Portal hypertension.\n\nMCQ 2.055"},"options_mode":"text","source_answer":null,"source_explanation":null