13 of her menstrual cycle, which is usually of 28 days duration. You have elected
to give her Postinor-2® (levonorgestrel 750ug) as a postcoital contraceptive. She
has requested information about any potential side effects and its efficacy.
Which one of the following statements regarding side effects and efficacy of the
fecommended treatment is correct?','{"A":"Vaginal spotting is likely within three days of the treatment being given.","B":"Menstruation is likely within seven days of the treatment being given.","C":"Nausea and vomiting occurs in about 50% of women given this treatment.","D":"Virilisation of a female fetus is likely if the treatment fails to prevent pregnancy.","E":"The treatment fails to prevent pregnancy in 2-3% of women treated.\n\nMCQ 2.107\n\nWhich one of the following differentiates acute alcoholic hallucinosis from delirium\ntremens?"}',NULL,NULL,'{"source_relative_path":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","supporting_pages":[97],"source_qid":"2.105","duplicate_group_id":"exact-ed8938a1a5e1","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"45a2899c574b0a6caf6e","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_relative_path":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_page":97,"source_qid":"2.105"}],"parser_version":"2.8-residual-resolver-selective-ocr-visual-2026-09-22","parser_mode":"v28_multi_question_group","text_method":"tesseract","visual_asset":null,"asset_preview_url":null}',NULL,NULL,'text',NULL,'needs_verification','[]','high','{"record_id":"45a2899c574b0a6caf6e","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_relative_path":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_year":null,"source_page":97,"supporting_pages":[97],"source_qid":"2.105","domain_hint":"Mixed/Unclassified","stem":"An 18-year-old woman comes to see you eight hours after she was raped on day\n13 of her menstrual cycle, which is usually of 28 days duration. You have elected\nto give her Postinor-2® (levonorgestrel 750ug) as a postcoital contraceptive. She\nhas requested information about any potential side effects and its efficacy.\nWhich one of the following statements regarding side effe