her in the previous pregnancies. Which one of the following is the most appropriate Ww
method of relieving her symptoms? |','{"A":"Rest in bed in hospital. 4","B":"Anticoagulant therapy with low-dose heparin. Cc","C":"Use of pressure stockings and a vulval pad. D","D":"Surgical ligation and stripping of the affected veins. E","E":"Injection of sclerosing solution into the affected veins. |\n=\nN\nMCQ 2.111\nA 65-year-old woman presents with a sudden, persisting visual loss in the right |\neye. She had a history of continual ipsilateral headache for the past 12 months of d\nprogressively increasing severity prior to the acute episode. She has a 45 pack-year |\nsmoking history. Which one of the following investigations is most likely to establish 4\n\nthe diagnosis?\n\nChest X-ray.\n\nRight carotid duplex ultrasound.\n\n« Full blood count.\n\nErythrocyte sedimentation rate (ESR).\nComputed tomography (CT) head.\n\n——\nMCQ 2.112\n\nMOOR >\nMr an\n\nA 63-year-old woman develops pain and swelling of her left calf five days after a\nlaparotomy for perforated diverticular disease. On examination there is some\nswelling around the ankle and dorsum of the foot and tenderness in the soleus,\nWhich one of the following would be the most appropriate investigation to perform\nto establish a cause for the current problem?"}',NULL,NULL,'{"source_relative_path":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","supporting_pages":[],"source_qid":"2.109","duplicate_group_id":"exact-dd88526c610c","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"8303ca86c33e8dc71f72","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_relative_path":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","source_page":98,"source_qid":"2.109"}],"parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","parser_mode":"strict_ocr_tolerant","text_method":"tesseract","visual_asset":null,"asset_preview_url":null}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'needs_verification','[]','medium','{"record_id":"8303ca86c33e8dc71f72","source_fi