MCQ 2.121
A 25-year-old woman presents with a two-month
history of a painless mass appearing in the neck.
Examination shows a 5cm_ fluctuant smooth
round mass in the upper anterior triangle of the
neck as illustrated, partly covered by the upper
third of the sternomastoid. Which one of the
following is the most likely diagnosis?','{"A":"Hodgkin lymphoma.","B":"Thyroglossal duct cyst.","C":"Salivary gland tumour.","D":"Branchial cyst (lateral lymphoepithelial cyst).","E":"Tuberculous lymphadenitis.\n\nMCQ 2.122\n\nA 45-year-old man presents seeking a prescription for oral antifungal treatment\nfor self-diagnosed systemic candidiasis. He says that he has recently visited a\nnaturopath who told him that he has had multiple food allergies and yeast\nsensitivity ever since he was given penicillin injections for tonsillitis as a child, by his\nthen general practitioner. He becomes quite insistent and adamant that he must\nhave treatment without delay and becomes angry when you are reluctant to write\nout a prescription without further investigations. His somatic beliefs about systemic\ncandidiasis are an example of which one of the following?\n\nA. An overvalued idea.\n\nB. An induced somatic delusion.\nC. Factitious disorder.\n\nD. Body dysmorphism.\n\nE. Perceptual disturbance.\n\nMCQ 2.123\n\nA 70-year-old woman presents with weight loss of 3kg, vague headaches, aching all |\nover the body and morning stiffness of the shoulder and hip girdles. These symptoms\nhave been present for the past six months. Physical examination is normal, except for |\nsome tenderness in the muscles of her shoulder. Investigations show a normochromic |\nnormocytic. anaemia, erythrocyte sedimentation rate (ESR) of 65 mm/h (5-20) and\nraised C-reactive protein. All other investigations, including muscle enzymes, are\nnormal. Which one of the following is the most likely diagnosis?\n\n. Multiple myeloma.\nPolymyalgia rheumatica.\n. Rheumatoid arthritis.\nOccult malignancy.\nPolymyositis.\n\n=\n\nMOQORP>"}',NULL,NULL,'{"source_relative_path":"96.Handbook of Multiple Choice Questions (Vernon Marshall).pdf","supporting_pages":[],"source_qid":"2.121","duplicate_group_id":"exact-c71bae9ee402","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"82d58e22ed4f31bb997b","record_type":"text_mcq","source_fil